Python 3 / GTK3 port (2026)
---------------------------
CNC Proton <info@cnc-proton.com>
https://github.com/cnc-proton/nativecam-py3-gtk3

This port migrated the entire application from Python 2.7 and PyGTK/GTK2
to Python 3 and PyGObject/GTK3 for Debian 13 Trixie and LinuxCNC 2.9+.
The work included rewriting the UI stack, updating thousands of API calls,
GladeVCP embedding fixes, Debian packaging, and new milling features
(Side Drill, workpiece-based center handling, INI editor robustness).

